# RPM Apprentice Firmware

Firmware releases and update tools for the WMH Racing RPM Apprentice.

1.027 - exe, download and install, enables OTA updates through future Android app
1.028 - First OTA update, must manually update to 1.027 before running OTA update in the Android app
1.029 - Fix scrolling on the app and added reset button
1.032 - Added reset functionality for WiFi ssid and password


# Android Beta App
1.00 - Beta App for Android, what more can I say...  Printing available through 58mm bluetooth receipt printers
